Hi dear cat lovers! The release of our game is coming very soon. As tradition, we'd like to offer you the opportunity to suggest a name for achievements in the game. Each name will refer to one random cat.

Here is a small list of the rules according to which, we will be selecting names:
[list]

[*] 1 name per person;
[*] Write the name in English, otherwise it will be localized;
[*] No obviously absurd, forbidden, offensive names;
[*] You can submit at any time in the comments, up to the day of the game's release.
[/list]
That's it! We'll put everyone who wants to participate in the achievement and link it to a random cat on the map, after the release you will be able to unlock this achievement in the game. Thanks for your participation!

